Term	Meaning
Cursor	A memory area that holds query result
Ref Cursor	A pointer that can refer to different queries
SYS_REFCURSOR	Built-in weak cursor type
Strong Cursor	Has fixed return structure
Weak Cursor	Can return any type of result
